# The Celestial Nexus (Zilart 16), current. Gilgamesh plays 173. The fight entered and won (a GM): the mission's 32001
# finish completes the mission (Awakening next, the Burier of the Illusion title) and sets the char down in the Hall of
# the Gods, which shows at the next tick.
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger TheCelestialNexus/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=Norg pos=120.9,-8,-12 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheCelestialNexus current
login
trigger Gilgamesh                       # 173
finish
warp -580,-8,-30 TheCelestialNexus
trigger _513                            # the menu
update 32000 option=1                   # entered
finish
bfwin                                   # a GM: WON, 32001
finish                                  # completed; set down in the Hall of the Gods
tick 400
